  "details": "Right now you can only have a parameter driver act instantly, instead of being able to spread the change out over time like you can with the animator layer controller. This means that if you want a change in a parameter to be gradual you essentially have to create a loop that adds a tiny amount to the parameter over and over again while counting up until it's added enough times, which probably isn't great for performance and looks stuttery.",
